This folder holds the learner's own explanations, maps, worked examples, and corrections for {{TOPIC}}.

## Note rule

1. Preserve the unaided answer or prediction first.
2. Add source-backed corrections without replacing the original.
3. Link the relevant skill ID and practice evidence.
4. End with one retrieval prompt or next question.

Use [[notes/_note-template|the note template]] when a structured note is helpful.
